blocks.en:
Implications for imbalance research. Oversampling duplicates or interpolates minority patients that also appear in the test set, so leaky protocols reward strategies by how they interact with memorised minority identities. Once leakage is removed, and within the evaluated strategies, classifiers, tuning ranges and metrics, the information given to the model mattered more than the imbalance strategy: on the same targets, diagnostic history and image embeddings raised F2 far more than any sampler. Changing the label definition changed the measured relationships between modalities even more, but it also changes the target and its prevalence, so it is not a like-for-like gain. Checklist. Most items are established good practice [ 5 , 6 ] ; we list them because each would have caught a failure in our case study:
(1) split by patient, and evaluate at the level at which labels are defined;
(2) report the number of positive patients per target and per fold;
(3) include an all-positive baseline and a no-learning lookup baseline;
(4) for every selected model, report seen- vs. unseen-patient performance whenever a record split is used;
(5) select thresholds, samplers and fusion weights on inner validation data only, and declare binary variables and missingness indicators as categorical when oversampling;
(6) rebuild every label from the source codes, check which admission it comes from and what the matched codes mean, and document when each feature becomes available relative to the radiograph;
(7) when diagnostic targets can recur, include a prior-diagnosis baseline and give models the diagnostic history available at imaging time.

blocks.zh:
对不平衡研究的影响。 对同样出现在测试集中的少数群体患者进行过度抽样或插入,因此泄密协议通过如何与记忆中的少数群体身份互动来奖励策略. 一旦渗出被去除,在评估的战略、分类器、调试范围和度量标准内,提供给模型的信息比不平衡战略更重要:在相同的目标、诊断历史和图像嵌入上,F2比任何取样者都高得多。 改变标签定义更改变了模式之间的被测量关系,但也改变了目标及其普及性,因此它不是一个相似的收益. 明细表. 多数项目是既定的良好做法[5,6];我们列出这些项目是因为每个项目在我们案例研究中都会遇到失败:
(1) 由病人分开,并在界定标签的级别进行评估;
( 二 ) 报告 目标 和 每 叠 的 阳性 病人 数 ;
(3) 包括一个全正基线和不学习搜索基线;
( 四 ) 每 个 选取 的 模型 , 在 使用 分出 记录 时 , 报告 视同 隐形 病人 的 表现 ;
(5) 仅在内部验证数据上选择阈值、取样器和聚变权重,并在过度取样时宣布二进制变量和缺失指标为绝对;
(6) 从源代码重建每个标签,检查它来自哪一个承认,匹配的代码意味着什么,以及相对于射线图而言每个特征可用时的文件;
(7) 当诊断目标可能再起时,包括一个前诊断基线,并给出模型成像时可用的诊断史.
